# ── Data / Artifact Policy ──
#
# What IS committed (source of truth):
#   - data/raw/nfl/schedules.parquet              (raw ingest, tracked)
#   - data/features/nfl/feature_table.parquet      (built features, tracked)
#   - reports/experiments/*.md                     (experiment reports, tracked)
#   - reports/benchmarks/*.{md,csv}                (benchmark registry, tracked)
#   - reports/predictions/incumbent_predictions*.csv  (canonical predictions, tracked)
#
# What is NOT committed (generated at runtime):
#   - Any new *.parquet not already tracked              (build artifacts)
#   - reports/predictions/snapshots/                     (weekly snapshots)
#   - reports/predictions/rehearsal/                     (historical rehearsal)
#   - mlruns/                                            (MLflow tracking)

# Data — parquet ignores NEW files; existing tracked ones remain
*.parquet

# Reports — weekly predictions & rehearsal artifacts (hundreds per session)
reports/predictions/snapshots/
reports/predictions/rehearsal/

# MLflow
mlruns/

